  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You fill a 5-foot Cube centered on a point within range with whirling spectral daggers. Each creature in the Cube takes 4d4 Slashing damage. A creature also takes this damage when it enters the Cube or ends its turn there, or when the Cube moves into its space, but no more than once per turn.</p><p>On your later turns, you can take a Magic action to teleport the Cube up to 30 feet.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 for each spell slot level above 2.</p>",
